  "Olive & Ember: Neapolitan pizza, fresh pasta and Italian small plates, in Nottingham.",
  "Sunday: 12 noon till 8pm. Tuesday to Saturday: lunch 12 noon till 2:30pm, dinner 5:30pm till 10pm. Closed Mondays.",
  "Seating: inside (11 tables) and terrace (4 tables). The terrace is bookable; if the weather turns, we move you inside. We keep some tables back for walk-ins.",
  "Takeaway: click and collect by phone, evenings; food takes about 20 minutes. Takeaway can be paid by card over the phone or when you collect.",
