   "a": "You’re welcome to bring a birthday cake; there’s no cakeage charge.",
   "tags": ["cake","birthday","cakeage"]
  },
  {
   "q": "Do you sell gift vouchers?",
   "a": "Gift vouchers are available in the restaurant.",
   "tags": ["voucher","gift","present"]
  },
  {
   "q": "Do you have vegan or gluten-free options?",
   "a": "Plenty of vegetarian dishes, several vegan, and gluten-free pizza bases.",
   "tags": ["vegan","vegetarian","gluten","coeliac","dairy","dietary"]
  },
  {
   "q": "Are children welcome?",
   "a": "Children are very welcome, with highchairs and a kids’ menu. We have 3 highchairs.",
   "tags": ["children","kids","child","highchair","baby"]
  },
  {
   "q": "Is there a service charge?",
   "a": "A discretionary 12.5% service charge is added for tables of six or more.",
   "tags": ["service","charge","tip","gratuity"]
  },
  {
   "q": "What is your cancellation policy?",
   "a": "Please give 48 hours' notice to cancel or change. Deposits are refunded with 48 hours' notice.",
   "tags": ["cancel","cancellation","refund","deposit"]
  },
  {
   "q": "Do you take walk-ins?",
